==Trivia==
*'''Electromagnetic Wall''' does not damage a {{TCG ID|Wisdom of Sea and Sky|Porygon2|136}} which evolves from placing the Energy. 

===Origin===
*'''Electromagnetic Wall''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Dragons Exalted|Ampharos|40}} from the {{TCG|Dragons Exalted}} expansion.
*'''Mach Bolt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Undaunted|Jolteon|28}} from the {{TCG|Undaunted}} expansion.

